capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:BriefProfile contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement3">Hussian is a qualified Company Secretary and law graduate with around five years of experience in regulatory compliance, Corporate Governance, Company Secretarial, and legal functions. He was previously associated with Hiranandani Financial Services Private Limited, a Middle Layer NBFC, as Senior Manager – Compliance, Svamaan Financial Services (JSW Group), Catalyst Trusteeship Limited, Zee Entertainment Enterprises Limited, and IDBI Capital Markets &amp; Securities Limited. Holds a Bachelor of Laws (LL.B.), Bachelor of Commerce.</in-capmkt:BriefProfile><in-capmkt:Salutation contextRef="D_ResignationOfDirector1">Mr.</in-capmkt:Salutation><in-capmkt:NameOfTheDirectorOrKeyManagerialPersonnelOrSeniorManagementPersonnelOrComplianceOfficer contextRef="D_ResignationOfDirector1">Naveen Kottala</in-capmkt:NameOfTheDirectorOrKeyManagerialPersonnelOrSeniorManagementPersonnelOrComplianceOfficer><in-capmkt:DesignationOfDirectorOrKeyManagerialPersonnelOrSeniorManagementPersonnelOrComplianceOfficer contextRef="D_ResignationOfDirector1">Chief Executive Officer</in-capmkt:DesignationOfDirectorOrKeyManagerialPersonnelOrSeniorManagementPersonnelOrComplianceOfficer><in-capmkt:DateOnWhichTheResignationLetterWasReceived contextRef="D_ResignationOfDirector1">2026-10-01</in-capmkt:DateOnWhichTheResignationLetterWasReceived><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfResignation contextRef="I_ResignationOfDirector1">2026-10-21</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfResignation><in-capmkt:WhetherTheLetterOfResignationHasTheDetailedReasonForResignation contextRef="I_ResignationOfDirector1">true</in-capmkt:WhetherTheLetterOfResignationHasTheDetailedReasonForResignation><in-capmkt:ReasonOfResignationInBrief contextRef="D_ResignationOfDirector1">as per resignation letter</in-capmkt:ReasonOfResignationInBrief></xbrli:xbrl>
